rnia).\n    *   D) joey loves eye surgeries: There is no information suggesting Joey loves eye surgeries; the statement is about fixing his hernia.\n\nThe sarcasm lies in proposing a completely irrelevant medical procedure to fix the stated ailment.\n\nAnswer: $\boxed{C}$
