ns in volume (dynamics) particularly challenging compared to tracking the basic pattern (rhythm) or the general contour (melody/harmony) if the music is present at all.\n\nGiven the strong, continuous ambient noise, the subtle variations in volume that define **dynamics** are likely the most difficult element to accurately discern.\n\nAnswer: $\boxed{D}$
