tions provided, **court reporter-lawyer** (or two legal professionals) is the most fitting description for a conversation initiating a deposition where one party is addressed as "counselor."\n\nThe first speaker is likely setting up the deposition for the lawyer ("counselor").\n\nAnswer: $\boxed{B}$
