perimental pieces are very short. This is not a reliable contrast.\n\nThe most accurate and fundamental contrast between the broad categories of traditional classical music and experimental music relates to their approach to structure and rules. The music in the audio sounds structurally open compared to a typical classical piece.\n\nTherefore, option A provides the most accurate comparison and contrast.\n\nAnswer: $\boxed{A}$
