 right here when it cracked," and option A includes "right here," it is the most supported choice among the given options, assuming "right here" corresponds to the location implied by the context (outside).\n\n**Conclusion:** The audio explicitly states, "He was standing right here when it cracked." Option A includes this key phrase.\n\nAnswer: $\boxed{A}$
